### Lab 11 · Resiliencia
@pay = http://localhost:8104
@provider = http://localhost:8122

### ✅ Pago con los cinco patrones
POST {{pay}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": "pedido-1", "amount": 25}

### ❌ Sin protección (espera lo que tarde la pasarela)
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/naive
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": "pedido-2", "amount": 25}

### ❌ Reintentos inmediatos (retry storm)
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/naive-retry
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": "pedido-3", "amount": 25}

### Rechazo de negocio → 402, sin reintentos
POST {{pay}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": "pedido-4", "amount": 5000}

### Estado de un pago (PENDING_CONFIRMATION → APPROVED cuando el reconciliador lo confirma)
GET {{pay}}/api/payments/pedido-1

### Estado del circuito y pagos pendientes
GET {{pay}}/api/resilience

### ── Caos en la pasarela ──
PUT {{provider}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{"latencyMs": 3000}

###
PUT {{provider}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{"down": true}

###
PUT {{provider}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{"errorRate": 0.5}

### Normalidad
PUT {{provider}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Cuántas peticiones recibió la pasarela
GET {{provider}}/admin/stats

### Checkout (Python + tenacity)
POST http://localhost:8110/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": "pedido-5", "amount": 10}
